# Environment variable template for atm-fleet-toolkit.
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values locally.
# `.env` itself is git-ignored and must never be committed.
#
# This project currently ships as a pure simulation/modeling toolkit and
# requires no external services or API keys to run. This file exists as a
# placeholder/convention for future config (e.g. a data source path or a
# logging level) so the pattern is established up front.

# LOG_LEVEL=INFO
